      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SIN CITY BANDIT (1) was strongly supported last start when a short priced favourite and duly saluted winning by 5 lengths at this track in a handy 41.84. Well suited by the inside box and in form and has the ability. Ran the fastest time on the program in her latest win. Shapes as a top winning chance on latest effort. STILTON SHINE (5) is progressing well scoring last time out (41.71) at this track and bringing up her 9th career win. Form at this distance is sound. Has a strong record out of this box with two wins and a minor placing from four starts. Capable of going well again. NO SHAME (8) finished a 6 length second last start over 720m at this track in a swift 42.18. Smart time latest and looks a key chance on that form. GO FORWARD JACKI (7) was out of the money here last time out but can bounce back.",
